[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]嘉靖本 vs 毛本第七十九回差异（2026-04-30 核查✅）[/font][/b]


详见 `ref-yanyi-jiajing-mao-79hui-diff.md`，核心差异如下：


[indent]1.  [color=#000000]字号「正义」vs「正礼」[/color]：嘉靖本误作「正义」，毛本据正史改为「正礼」[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]2.  [color=#000000]丁仪台词[/color]：嘉靖本「谗臣贼子」较激烈，毛本省略「贼子」；嘉靖本「未及旬日」毛本改「未远」[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]3.  [color=#000000]丁廙台词结尾[/color]：嘉靖本「不识圣贤与禽兽何。异也」语义有误，毛本改为「何不识人才若此！」[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]4.  [color=#000000][color=#0066FF][url={"research": "许褚", "cat": "people"}]许褚[/url][/color]行动[/color]：嘉靖本「立轨直入」（「轨」疑「斩」讹误），毛本「立斩之」[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]5.  [color=#000000]毛本增补感叹[/color]：「及其被杀，人多惜之」为毛本新增，嘉靖本无[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]6.  [color=#000000]诛杀令[/color]：毛本增「先」字（「先将丁仪丁廙等尽行诛戳」），叙事层次更清晰[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


